        {"zh": "稻草从袖口漏出来。", "en": "Straw leaks from my sleeve."},
        {"zh": "我边走边哼怪调。", "en": "I hum a strange tune as I walk."},
        {"zh": "影子被南瓜灯拉得很长。", "en": "My lantern stretches my shadow long."}
